# ZeroS ad and tracker blocking (0.6.0)
#
# The blocklist (vendor/zeros/adblock/SOURCE) is laid over Android's hosts
# file before any app starts, so lookups of a listed domain fail in every app
# that uses the system's resolver. The Ad blocking tile (ZeroS's LineageParts)
# sets persist.sys.zeros.adblock: "false" removes the blocklist straight away;
# switching it back on applies at the next start. Persistent properties load
# after post-fs-data, so the blocklist goes on unconditionally here and comes
# off when the property says so.
#
# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

on post-fs-data
    mount none /system_ext/etc/zeros/hosts /system/etc/hosts bind

on property:persist.sys.zeros.adblock=false
    umount /system/etc/hosts
